        <body>
            <div xml:id="d232">

                <pb facs="0456" n="352" xml:id="pg352"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.4016/412: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Germany (Gordon)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-04-05T14:00:00-05:00">April 5, 1933—2
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>38. Your 56, April 4, 6 p.m. and 57, April 5, Noon. We have decided not to issue
                    a statement at the present juncture, as the situation here no longer offers a
                    suitable occasion for so doing.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
